      "side": 0,
      "message": "The capture types that are bpp 16 are the test images.\n\nLooking at [fp_download_frame](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/util/ectool.cc;l\u003d1878;bpv\u003d0#:~:text\u003d1877-,1878,-1879):\n\n```\nif (index \u003d\u003d FP_FRAME_INDEX_SIMPLE_IMAGE) {\n\t\tsize \u003d (size_t)info-\u003ewidth * info-\u003ebpp / 8 * info-\u003eheight;\n\t\tindex \u003d FP_FRAME_INDEX_RAW_IMAGE;\n\t} else if (index \u003d\u003d FP_FRAME_INDEX_RAW_IMAGE) {\n\t\tsize \u003d info-\u003eframe_size;\n```\n\nso `FP_FRAME_INDEX_SIMPLE_IMAGE` should have `info-\u003ebpp` of `8` to get half of the buffer, while `FP_FRAME_INDEX_RAW_IMAGE` should have an `info-\u003eframe_size` of `FP_SENSOR_IMAGE_SIZE_EGIS` (full buffer)",
